<title>USA: Titan Exploration oks $25 mln buyback.</title>
<headline>Titan Exploration oks $25 mln buyback.</headline>
<dateline>MIDLAND, Texas 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Titan Exploration Inc said Monday that its board had authorized the repurchase of up to $25 million of the company's common stock from time to time on the open market or through private transactions.</p>
<p>&quot;The stock repurchase program reflects our belief that Titan's stock provides an attractive investment opportunity for the company,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Titan shares closed down 1/4 Monday at 8-7/8.</p>
</text>
